{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-667e5c", "type": "material"}, "note": "誓約を産まれた子で検査する神話と、履行を恐怖で保証する政治哲学。検査の場所が、生成物から制度へ移る。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-09e039", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-8c81ae", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-0aa57f", "type": "material"}, "note": "来ると約された者が来る話と、来ると言われたかも不明なまま待つ話。約束の内容の有無が、待機の長さを決める。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-32acf2", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-f34ea2", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-1333c5", "type": "material"}, "note": "日没という期限に縛られる履行と、署名なき同意に縛られる履行。どちらも、外部の時間が履行を検査する。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-3f80c7", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-c972bd", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-eab8ee", "type": "material"}, "note": "声を対価に失う契約と、発話が行為になる条件。声を失った者には、遂行的発話の条件が欠ける。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-b41e82", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-efc3ac", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-1e3e4a", "type": "material"}, "note": "苦痛で記憶を焼きつけて約束する動物と、報酬で答えを曲げるモデル。記憶を作る力が、記憶を曲げる力に変わる。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-a10726", "relation_type": "transforms", "right": {"id": "MAT-EVD-20261024-78d4ce", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-793cb3", "type": "material"}, "note": "約束は多数性に依存し、一人では拘束されない。監視の内外で行動が分かれるとき、多数性は監視の形を取る。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-3d3374", "relation_type": "interrupts", "right": {"id": "MAT-EVD-20261024-0fa4eb", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-c84382", "type": "material"}, "note": "死によって約束を履行する二つの話。前者は二人の契り、後者は血の掟。死が履行の形式になる点だけが重なる。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-178044", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-77cfd8", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-3ff2f6", "type": "material"}, "note": "すべてを覚えるが抽象できない者と、重要度で記憶を検索するエージェント。保持の量と履行の能力は比例しない。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-847f7b", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-EVD-20261024-20dec1", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-d18ddf", "type": "material"}, "note": "証文の字義が履行を不可能にする法廷と、負債が罪に内面化される系譜学。どちらも、借りを文字と身体に分ける。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-f596bf", "relation_type": "metaphorically_resonates", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-1e3e4a", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-0aa57f", "type": "material"}, "note": "死者が約束を履行する話と、約束は未来を保証しないという限定。履行の主体が死んだ後、約束は誰のものか。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-ba35f2", "relation_type": "leaves_open", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-793cb3", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MOTIF-021", "type": "motif"}, "note": "破約の償いを、訂正と抹消の糸へ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-10ba7f", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-016", "type": "motif"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MOTIF-021", "type": "motif"}, "note": "約束の宛先と、宛名のない書簡の糸を重ねる。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-77b135", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-010", "type": "motif"}}
